  "body": "If you've been searching for a home that offers plenty of space without stretching the budget, 6 Lisa Rise deserves your attention!\r\n\r\nOffering three bedrooms, one bathroom, two toilets, and generous open-plan living across two levels, this is an opportunity for buyers who want more room, more flexibility and excellent everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the spacious living and dining area is filled with natural light, with large windows and sliding doors opening to the private, fully fenced backyard. There's plenty of room for entertaining, children to play, or simply enjoying a sunny afternoon at home.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen offers ample storage, a breakfast bar, and an easy connection to the dining area, while a heat pump keeps the main living space comfortable year-round.\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms and two separate toilets, there's flexibility for families of different sizes, while internal-access garaging adds another layer of convenience.\r\n\r\nOutside, there's a lovely balance of lawn and paved entertaining areas, perfect for children, pets and relaxed weekends at home. \r\n\r\nThe location is another major advantage. Families will appreciate having excellent schools nearby, including Wakaaranga School, Farm Cove Intermediate, Macleans College and Pakuranga College, while Highland Park & Half Moon Bay shops, supermarkets, cafés and everyday amenities are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nIf space, location and value are high on your wishlist, make sure 6 Lisa Rise is on your viewing list!\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale: 4:00pm, Thursday 26 November 2026 (unless sold prior)",
